    "title": "Solitaire",
    "description": "This classic Klondike Solitaire by Conifer is the most popular card game in the world. This is the card game you're familiar with, it's been popular since the 1990s, people used to only play it on PC, now you can play it on mobile phones and tablets, and it's free! You will definitely fall in love with it!  With beautiful graphics, fun animations, and offline mode, Solitaire is the best game to pass the time, relax, and exercise your brain!\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n\r\nOriginal Classic Solitaire: \r\n\u2665\ufe0f Play Klondike solitaire draw 1 & draw 3 modes\r\n\u2665\ufe0f Choose scoring mode: Standard or Vegas solitaire scoring\r\n\r\nDaily Challenge:\r\n\u2660\ufe0f Challenge yourself with the hard mode\r\n\u2660\ufe0f Receive special mark everyday\r\n\u2663\ufe0f Record every achievement you made\r\n\u2663\ufe0f Stay Sharp and see every improvement\r\n\r\nUser Friendly Experience:\r\n\u2666\ufe0f Enjoy clean and comfortable visual design\r\n\u2666\ufe0f Use new props to make your gameplay more easy\r\n\u2666\ufe0f Play Offline: Play random deals everywhere\r\n\u2666\ufe0f Supports left-handed play",
